  walkingStoryText:
  - Chlo... University se aa kar khana khaa lia... Thora Rest kr leta ho
  - "Yaar honestly\u2026 university ne Dmagh khrab kr dya hai."
  - "Timing dekho\u2026 kehte hain 11 se 4, lekin poora din hi nikal jata hai."
  - "Allah Allah kr k Ek chutti mil jaye na, aglay hafte seedha 8 se 5:30\u2026 Wah
    Shampi Wah"
  - Areeey Yar, Aj to Assignment ki Last date b hai... Chalo Wo Complete kar leta
    ho
  - "Bhai Humari neend ka bhi koi makeup lagwa do. Roz class, lab, ar phir class\u2026 "
  - "Ghar walay kehte hain focus karo, warna next topic shuru ho jata hai \u2014
    shadi."
  - Ammi bolti hain, 'Bas degree complete kar lo.' Abhi complete bhi nahi hui aur
    rishtay loading pe hain.
  - "Idhar GPA ka tension, udhar future ka stress \u2014 balance hi nahi ban raha."
  - Neend full zero, Stress full hundred. Oo My yes!!!
  - "Bas ek hi soch hoti hai \u2014 aaj ka din kisi tarah nikal jaye."
  - "Lekin nahi\u2026 aaj assignment bhi submit karna hai."
  - "Chalo, PC kholte hain\u2026 Allah khair kare."
  tiredText:
  - "Assignment ne dimagh ka dahi kar diya\u2026 Itny Errorssss!!"
  - "Bhai thoda sa nap le leta hoon\u2026"
  - Shayad thora Sukoon Mil jay
